This attribute controls whether the data can be read and written or whether it is to be handled read-only.</xsd:documentation>
               <xsd:appinfo source="tags">mmt.qualifiedName="DiagnosticValueNeeds.diagnosticValueAccess";pureMM.maxOccurs="1";pureMM.minOccurs="0"</xsd:appinfo>
            </xsd:annotation>
