The minimum value is 0.</xsd:documentation>
               <xsd:appinfo source="tags">mmt.qualifiedName="EndToEndTransformationComSpecProps.maxErrorStateValid";pureMM.maxOccurs="1";pureMM.minOccurs="0"</xsd:appinfo>
