atpVariation: Derived, because TpNode can vary.</xsd:documentation>
               <xsd:appinfo source="tags">atp.Splitkey="tpConnection, tpConnection.variationPoint.shortLabel";mmt.RestrictToStandards="CP";mmt.qualifiedName="LinTpConfig.tpConnection";pureMM.maxOccurs="-1";pureMM.minOccurs="0";vh.latestBindingTime="postBuild"</xsd:appinfo>
