Applicable for: AbstractServiceInstance.methodActivationRoutingGroup
Not Applicable for: ConsumedEventGroup.pduActivationRoutingGroup
Not Applicable for: EventHandler.pduActivationRoutingGroup</xsd:documentation>
               <xsd:appinfo source="tags">mmt.qualifiedName="PduActivationRoutingGroup.variationPoint";pureMM.maxOccurs="1";pureMM.minOccurs="0";xml.sequenceOffset="10000"</xsd:appinfo>
