If the [ARMetaClassRole{minimumInterArrivalTime}{PeriodicEventTriggering}] is less than the
[ARMetaClassRole{period}{PeriodicEventTriggering}] minus the [ARMetaClassRole{jitter}{PeriodicEventTriggering}], then the [ARMetaClassRole{minimumInterArrivalTime}{PeriodicEventTriggering}] has no effect on the properties of the constraint.</xsd:documentation>
               <xsd:appinfo source="tags">mmt.qualifiedName="PeriodicEventTriggering.minimumInterArrivalTime";pureMM.maxOccurs="1";pureMM.minOccurs="0";xml.sequenceOffset="10"</xsd:appinfo>
