            <xsd:annotation>
               <xsd:documentation>States whether the scheduled entities in an LET interval shall use pipelined execution or not i.e. "permitted pipelining property"
If TRUE, then the scheduled entities must implement pipelining.
If FALSE or undefined, no pipelining applies.</xsd:documentation>
               <xsd:appinfo source="tags">atp.Status="draft";mmt.qualifiedName="TimingDescriptionEventChain.isPipeliningPermitted";pureMM.maxOccurs="1";pureMM.minOccurs="0"</xsd:appinfo>
