               <xsd:documentation>The [ARMetaClass{LatencyTimingConstraint}] is seen from the perspective of the [ARMetaClassRole{response}{TimingDescriptionEventChain}] event of the [ARMetaClassRole{scope}{LatencyTimingConstraint}]. Given a certain [ARMetaClassRole{response}{TimingDescriptionEventChain}] event, the age interval of the latest [ARMetaClassRole{stimulus}{TimingDescriptionEventChain}] is constrained.</xsd:documentation>
