- Both participants can transmit and receive MACsec protected traffic through the SC.</xsd:documentation>
               <xsd:appinfo source="tags">atp.EnumerationLiteralIndex="1";mmt.qualifiedName="MacSecFailPermissiveModeEnum.timeout"</xsd:appinfo>
